*helpFrameSubPointMsg:		Delete a reshape point from a frame
*helpFramePlanFirstMsg:		Moves frame to foreground
*helpFramePlanLastMsg:		Moves frame to background
*helpFramePlanUpMsg:		Moves a frame forward one level
*helpFramePlanDownMsg:		Moves a frame back one level
*helpFrameLockMsg:	  	Locks / Unlocks frames

